{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>And he charged them, etc.</b> Since previously he called his son Joseph and adjured him to attend to his burial, they might think that he obligated only Joseph and not them; therefore he charged all of them together, for all of them were to be involved in it. And there was no need to adjure them, for they would do as he said, as I explained regarding Joseph's words to Jacob (Genesis 47:30): ״אָנֹכִי אֶעֱשֶׂה כִדְבָרֶיךָ״."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:51:03.736201612Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}